</p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300836215350.Jpeg" style="width: 4.302083in; height: 3.035417in" alt="202508300836218252.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1 </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><a style="text-decoration: none;"></a><a style="text-decoration: none;"></a><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">8月23日</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">上午，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中教育集团2025级新生国防教育开营仪式</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校田径场</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">顺利</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">举行。校党委副书记、校长蒋明，副校长杨佩琼</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">朱水军</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">冯王亮，市教育局专职督学任联君，龙山书院管委会主任裘东，越城区人武部副部长安丰达，东浦街道人武部部长凌铁钢</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等领导，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">与</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全体</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高一</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">新</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">生、教官</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、班主任等共同</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">参加仪式。仪式由德育处负责人马丹娜主持。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300836211225.Jpeg" style="width: 3.052083in; height: 2.288889in" alt="202508300836216818.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300836217992.Png" style="width: 3.333333in; height: 2.486111in" alt="202508300836216187.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300836212954.Jpeg" style="width: 3.207639in; height: 2.405555in" alt="202508300836210029.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><a style="text-decoration: none;"></a><a style="text-decoration: none;"></a><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>       </strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>领导动员：</strong></span><a style="text-decoration: none;"></a><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>殷殷嘱托寄</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>厚望</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">仪式上，蒋明庄严颁布军训动员令。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">代表学校向全体新生表示欢迎，并向承训教官和老师们致以</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">诚挚</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">感谢。他强调，军训不仅是国防教育的重要课堂，更是素质拓展和规则意识养成的关键环节，尤其在</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>抗战胜利80周年</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">这一特殊年份更具深远意义。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">希望同学们</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>铸牢爱国魂</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>锻造素质链</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>绷紧纪律弦</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，将军训作为高中生活的奠基之</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">课</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，用汗水浇灌成长，用纪律规范行为，最终</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">遇见更挺拔、更坚韧、更优秀的自己</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300836213149.Jpeg" style="width: 3.395833in; height: 2.546528in" alt="202508300836216502.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><em>5</em></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-fami