 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>学子新声：青春誓言迎挑战</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高一（1）班姚馨怡同学代表全体新生向学校承诺</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">将以最饱满的热情迎接挑战，以最坚定的意志直面考验，以军人标准严格要求自我，做到服从指挥、团结协作、无畏艰难、不负期望，用汗水书写青春，用行动彰显担当，展现一中学子昂扬奋发的精神风貌。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300836211029.Jpeg" style="width: 3.385417in; height: 2.538889in" alt="202508300836212738.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><em>7</em></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 1